### 🧪 Triage Result (Round {{review_round}})

      - decision_needed: {{decision_count}}
      - patch: {{patch_count}}
      - defer: {{defer_count}}
      - dismissed (dropped as noise): {{dismiss_count}}

**🔎 Code Review Findings (Round {{review_round}}), {user_name}!**

      **Story:** {{story_file}}
      **Git vs Story Discrepancies:** {{git_discrepancy_count}}
      **Triage:** {{decision_count}} decision-needed, {{patch_count}} patch, {{defer_count}} defer, {{dismiss_count}} dismissed
      Findings recorded under "Review Follow-ups (AI)" in the story file.

step.action:
Add or update a "Senior Developer Review (AI)" section in the story file (placed above Change Log, below Dev Agent Record):

      **Reviewer:** {user_name}
      **Date:** {{date}}
      **Review Outcome:** {{review_outcome}}
      **Severity Breakdown:** {{high_count}} High, {{medium_count}} Medium, {{low_count}} Low (counted across decision_needed + patch findings; defer/dismiss excluded)

      Under it, add or update an "**Action Items**" subsection mirroring the Round {{review_round}} findings:
        - decision_needed: `- [ ] [Decision][{{severity}}] {{title}} — {{detail}} [{{file}}:{{line}}]`
        - patch: `- [ ] [Patch][{{severity}}] {{title}} [{{file}}:{{line}}]`
        - defer: `- [x] [Defer] {{title}} [{{file}}:{{line}}] — deferred, pre-existing`

      Rationale: enables dev-story's review_continuation mode on subsequent runs and lets dev-story Step 8 cross-mark resolved items via description match.
